# SSL Certificate Placeholder
#
# This directory is for SSL/TLS certificates.
# In production, mount your certificates here:
#
#   - cert.pem: SSL certificate (can include intermediate certs)
#   - key.pem: Private key
#
# For local development, you can generate self-signed certificates:
#
#   openssl req -x509 -nodes -days 365 -newkey rsa:2048 \
#     -keyout nginx/ssl/key.pem \
#     -out nginx/ssl/cert.pem \
#     -subj "/C=US/ST=State/L=City/O=OpenLMS/CN=localhost"
#
# For production, use Let's Encrypt or your certificate provider.
#
# IMPORTANT: Never commit real certificates to version control!
# This directory is listed in .gitignore.
